ždá route","řetězec — přesná shoda","vzor — celá sekce",{"ran":51,"cached":52,"skipped":53},"spustil se","už načteno","neodpovídá",{"title":55,"lead":56,"key":57,"note":58},"Záložní jazyk","Klíč, který aktivní jazyk nemá, se vyhodnotí přes fallbackLocale, místo aby zůstal prázdný.","Klíč","Zálohují se jen chybějící klíče. Co vykreslí klíč chybějící všude, určuje fallbackValue.",{"site.tagline":60,"nav.home":61,"nav.docs":62,"nav.examples":63,"nav.playground":64,"nav.github":8,"nav.npm":9,"nav.language":65,"lang.en":11,"lang.cs":12,"lang.de":13,"banner.v3":66,"error.title":67,"error.404":68,"error.default":69,"error.home":70,"playground":71},"Internationalization for SvelteKit","Home","Documentation","Examples","Playground","Language","This is the documentation for v3. For the v2 line, see the {{branch}} branch.","Something went wrong","This page does not exist.","An unexpected error occurred.","Back to the homepage",{"title":64,"lead":72,"source":73,"output":74,"parser":75,"preprocess":84,"loaders":89,"fallback":103},"Every panel below drives a real instance through the public API. Change an input and the library answers — nothing here is a recording.","Show the code","Output",{"title":76,"lead":77,"format":78,"flavour":79,"message":80,"payload":81,"locale":82,"silent":83},"Message formats","The core holds no message format of its own: a parser fills the slot. Curly comes with this package; ICU is the alternative, on the core directly.","Message format",{"curly":28,"icu":29},"Message","Payload","Locale","No reports. A report never raises — the placeholder takes its fallback and the rest of the message resolves.",{"title":85,"lead":86,"input":87,"note":88},"Preprocessing","Nested translations become the flat keys t() reads. The mode decides how far that goes.","Translations","rawTranslations keeps the input as it arrived; translations is what you see here.",{"title":90,"lead":91,"locale":82,"route":41,"load":92,"invalidate":93,"reset":44,"empty":94,"shape":95,"status":99},"Loaders","A loader runs when its locale matches and its routes match the current route, once per freshness window. Load the same route twice and watch the second attempt do nothing.","Load translations","Invalidate","Pick a locale and a route, then load.",{"every":96,"exact":97,"pattern":98},"no routes — every route","a string — exact match","a pattern — a whole section",{"ran":100,"cached":101,"skipped":102},"ran","already loaded","did not match",{"title":104,"lead":105,"key":106,"note":107},"Fallback locale","A key the active locale does not carry resolves through fallbackLocale instead of rendering empty.","Key","Only the missing keys fall back. What a key missing everywhere renders as is fallbackValue."],"uses":{"url":1}},{"type":"data","data":[{"code":1},{"parser":2,"preprocess":5,"loaders":6,"fallback":7},{"curly":3,"icu":4},"\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { I18n } \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sveltekit-i18n'\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i18n\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> I18n\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#2